ults page.\n370-\n371-#### Test: RecentSearches displays multiple recent searches in order\n--\n452-- **Initial state**: Results page showing round trip search with return Apr 1\n453-- **Action**: User clicks the return date parameter in the summary bar\n454-- **Expected**: A date picker opens with Apr 1 selected. User selects Apr 5. The search re-executes with the new return date and results update.\n455-\n456-#### Test: SearchSummaryBar inline edit passengers\n457:- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar, PassengerCountSelector\n458-- **Initial state**: Results page showing search with 1 adult\n459-- **Action**: User clicks the passenger count parameter in the summary bar\n460-- **Expected**: A passenger selector dropdown opens showing Adults: 1, Children: 0, Infants: 0. User increments adults to 2 and closes. The search re-executes with 2 adults and results update with new pricing.\n461-\n462-#### Test: SearchSummaryBar inline edit cabin class","numLines":98}}
